<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa's Eskom raises $50 mln Euro loan.</title>
<headline>S.Africa's Eskom raises $50 mln Euro loan.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's state-owned electricity generator Eskom said on Tuesday it had completed a $50 million five-year club loan in the Euro market.</p>
</text>
